# The web app's env for the Playwright e2e run (JEF-656). CI's `e2e` job copies
# this file to apps/web/.env; a local run copies it to the gitignored
# apps/web/.env.e2e, which apps/web/e2eEnv.ts hands to the web server. The API's
# half is apps/api/.env.e2e.example.
#
# The browser reaches the API through the dev/preview proxy, so the URL is
# relative. Ports are not set here: WEB_PORT and API_PORT live in apps/web/.env
# (devPorts.ts), which `pnpm setup:worktree` fills in per worktree.
VITE_API_URL=/graphql
